// === GRA-801: Storyline Ch.5 — first-star convoy manifest preset ===
// RON-only; no `src/` change in this PR. The loader is the CTO child
// (GRA-813, PR #256) which pattern-matches to `freighter_templates`
// and `AnomaliesFile`. Until that loader lands, this file is the
// authoritative design record for the smallest legal interstellar
// convoy — the antimatter-catalyzed precursor that fires from Sol
// toward the first extrasolar target.
//
// Hull-id substitution note (issue body vs ship_hulls.ron):
//   antimatter_destroyer_frame      → does NOT exist in ship_hulls.ron
//   long_range_destroyer_frame      → exists (assets/data/ship_hulls.ron:746)
//
// The CTO's GRA-813 child uses `long_range_destroyer_frame` for the
// destroyer slot; this preset follows the same id so the loader's
// hull-id validator passes without a Rust-side enum change.
//
// Schema contract (loader PR will turn each preset into a runtime
// `ConvoyPreset` resource):
//
//   id             — stable id, e.g. "interstellar_precursor_minimum"
//   display_name   — toast / dossier label
//   description    — player-facing tooltip text
//   era_tier       — minimum tech era required (4 = antimatter / first-star)
//   required_tech — optional gate; locks the preset behind a single
//                    research project
//   min_starbase   — whether the preset must include at least one
//                    mobile_starbase_frame (true here: the starbase
//                    is the only hull in the roster that can sustain
//                    the antimatter-catalyzed drive's thermal load
//                    for a multi-decade extrasolar transit)
//   hulls[]        — entries are `hull_id` + `count`; loader validates
//                    against `ship_hulls.ron` and requires count >= 1
//   tags[]         — free-form, surfaced in the fleet picker filter

(
    presets: [
        // ── GRA-801 Ch.5: The first star (sim-days 15000–50000) ────────
        // The "fire the precursor" beat — antimatter catalysis turns
        // the heliopause probe into a one-shot extrasolar convoy.
        // One mobile starbase carries the antimatter-catalyzed drive
        // and its thermal radiators; one fleet escort frigate
        // screens the starbase on departure and through the heliopause
        // pass; one long-range destroyer carries the probe payload
        // and the long-baseline survey instruments that produce the
        // first extrasolar anomaly read. Three hulls, one act.
        (
            id: "interstellar_precursor_minimum",
            display_name: "Interstellar Precursor (minimum legal)",
            description: "The smallest fleet that can be fired toward another star: one Mobile Starbase carrying the antimatter-catalyzed drive and its thermal radiators, one Fleet Escort Frigate screening the starbase through the heliopause pass, and one Long-Range Destroyer carrying the probe payload and the long-baseline survey instruments that read the first non-Sol anomaly. Antimatter era; requires the antimatter-catalyzed prototype research line.",
            era_tier: 4,
            required_tech: Some("antimatter_containment_structures"),
            min_starbase: true,
            hulls: [
                (hull_id: "mobile_starbase_frame", count: 1),
                (hull_id: "fleet_escort_frigate_frame", count: 1),
                (hull_id: "long_range_destroyer_frame", count: 1),
            ],
            tags: ["convoy", "first-star", "interstellar", "antimatter", "ch5", "tier-4"],
        ),
    ],
)